    "core_concept": {
      "core_clusters": [
        {
          "label_cn": "特许经营权；特许经营企业；加盟店；电影、游戏或书籍等相互关联的系列或知识产权；公民权，选举权；（职业体育联盟中的）球队及其经营组织",
          "label_en": "an authorization to sell a company's goods or services in a particular place; a business or outlet operated under a franchise agreement; a connected series or intellectual property of films, games, books, or similar works; a statutory right or privilege granted to a person or group by a government (especially the rights of citizenship and the right to vote); a professional sports team and its operating organization within a league",
          "pos": "noun",
