      "core_meaning_cn": "特许经营权、店或系列作品；投票权；职业球队；授予特许",
      "core_meaning_en": "a franchise right, business, series, vote, or sports organization; grant a franchise",
      "mental_model_cn": "商业语境可为特许经营权或加盟店，影视为系列作品，政治语境可为投票权；体育franchise可指职业球队和经营组织。动词为授予特许。",
      "mental_model_en": "In business, a franchise is a licence or the business operating under it; in media, it is a series of works; in sport, a professional team organization. Political uses include voting rights; the verb means grant a franchise."
